Package: bol-linux
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bol contributors <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, python3-tk, pipewire-bin, wl-clipboard, libnotify-bin, ffmpeg
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal, xclip, xdotool, x11-utils
Homepage: https://github.com/sabr6906i/Kivi-for-linux
Description: Linux voice typing and writing workspace
 Bol provides dictation, reviewable voice editing, text-to-speech, and optional
 account preference sync. Speech engines include Sarvam, compatible APIs,
 ElevenLabs through its helper, and a separately configured local whisper.cpp.
 Hyprland is the primary desktop integration. Other desktops may use clipboard
 output and manually assigned shortcuts; see the desktop support matrix.
